---
description: Restart the Moth desktop usage widget
allowed-tools: Bash(powershell.exe:*)
---

Restart the **Moth** desktop usage widget — the always-on-top card that shows Claude Code usage.

Run exactly this with the Bash tool:

```
powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "__RESTART_PATH__"
```

The script prints a single line starting with `OK:` or `ERROR:`. Relay it to me in one short sentence — confirm Moth is back up (with its PID), or, if it errored, tell me to check `__ROOT__\widget-error.log`. Do nothing else.
